# Display text on the language page in play (fixtures/langf6: dialkey's
# save, Twinsen by scene 1's message zone 12, and sound's lba.cfg,
# English voices). F6's options, Choose language, where Display text
# follows the voices: Return turns it to Don't display text, back to the
# game, where Space speaks the zone's message, its text hidden, as
# FlagDisplayText: OFF has the game speak it. The lba.cfg left says
# FlagDisplayText: OFF.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 12
shot start
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot hidden
key Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
key Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot back
hold 0.15
key space
sleep 2
shot speaking
sleep 10
shot end
